    # "You search around the area for a while, but there seem to be nothing worth noting nearby."
    "你在附近搜寻了一阵，但周围似乎没有什么值得注意的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite mossy_freshwater_loop_c78bb1b6:

    # "Around the river, you wander and pick up a certain plant, it was a Reed."
    "你沿着河边漫步，随手采下一株植物，原来是芦苇。"

translate schinese_rewrite mossy_freshwater_loop_cf967e5f:

    # "You put the reed in your bag, you now have [item_number] Reed."
    "你把芦苇放进背包，现在拥有[item_number]根芦苇。"

translate schinese_rewrite mossy_freshwater_loop_a5ea90ba:

    # "You put the reed in your bag, you now have [item_number] Reeds."
    "你把芦苇放进背包，现在拥有[item_number]根芦苇。"

translate schinese_rewrite mossy_freshwater_loop_55cb61f1:

    # "Along the river bank, you notice that there's a patch of small flowers nearby, you go and pick it up, it was a sage."
    "沿着河岸，你注意到附近有一片小花，便走过去采下，原来是鼠尾草。"

translate schinese_rewrite mossy_freshwater_loop_04a4170f:

    # "You put the sage flower in your bag, you now have [item_number] sage flower."
    "你把鼠尾草花放进背包，现在拥有[item_number]朵鼠尾草花。"

translate schinese_rewrite mossy_freshwater_loop_f3e88ff2:

    # "You put the sage flower in your bag, you now have [item_number] sage flowers."
    "你把鼠尾草花放进背包，现在拥有[item_number]朵鼠尾草花。"

translate schinese_rewrite mossy_freshwater_loop_0471f10b:

    # "You walk on the side of the river, and notice something shiny... it was a recipe."
    "你沿着河边走，注意到某样东西在闪闪发光……原来是一份配方。"

translate schinese_rewrite mossy_freshwater_loop_15e9e757:

    # "You quickly approach and pick it up. It says..."
    "你快步上前将它捡起。上面写着……"

translate schinese_rewrite mossy_freshwater_loop_ff5935ea:

    # "{i}...To make a trowel... craft with two slimeballs and two pieces of wood.{/i}"
    "{i}……若要制作泥铲……用两个粘液球和两块木头合成。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite mossy_freshwater_loop_f037af02:

    # "...You put the notes away, it seems you've learnt how to make a trowel."
    "……你把笔记收好，看来已经学会了制作泥铲。"

translate schinese_rewrite mossy_freshwater_loop_7ab5ba61:

    # "After walking along the river for a while, you decide to walk downstream along the river."
    "沿着河流走了一段时间后，你决定顺流而下。"

translate schinese_rewrite mossy_freshwater_loop_4d13f8eb:

    # "It takes a long time for you to explore the forest as the river water splashes against your legs."
    "你在森林里探索了很长时间，河水不断拍打着你的双腿。"

translate schinese_rewrite mossy_freshwater_loop_2d3f5440:

    # "And soon, you notice an abandoned bridge that marks the abrupt end of the river, if not counting all the flood surrounding this location."
    "很快，你注意到一座废弃的桥，标志着河流的戛然而止——若不算包围着此地的洪水。"

translate schinese_rewrite mossy_freshwater_loop_8d02a7d8:

    # "You take out your map and check your surrounding, this place must be the riverside crossing."
    "你拿出地图查看周围，这里一定就是河边的渡口。"

translate schinese_rewrite mossy_freshwater_loop_e91ba75d:

    # "You search around the area for a while, but there seem to be nothing worth noting nearby."
    "你在附近搜寻了一会儿，但周围似乎没有什么值得注意的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite mossy_freshwater_loop_e9de0dcf:

    # "You look into the river and found something grainy under the water."
    "你朝河里看去，发现水下有些颗粒状的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite mossy_freshwater_loop_ae8ac4b1:

    # "You use your trowel and soon dig up a piece of clay. You carefully store it in your bag."
    "你用泥铲很快挖出一块粘土，小心翼翼地把它收进背包。"

translate schinese_rewrite mossy_freshwater_loop_06648869:

    # "You now have [item_num] pieces of clay."
    "你现在有[item_num]块粘土。"

translate schinese_rewrite mossy_freshwater_loop_7a4dea47:

    # "You try to dig through the mud with your bare hand... but to no avail, it seems to not work."
    "你试着徒手挖开泥土……但毫无作用，看来这样行不通。"

translate schinese_rewrite mossy_freshwater_loop_0ba9ac66:

    # "You decide to move on, maybe you need something small that can dig..."
    "你决定继续前进，也许你需要某种小巧的挖掘工具……"

translate schinese_rewrite mossy_freshwater_loop_fd01265d:

    # "Under the river bed, you found something glowing faintly, hidden deep between the rocks."
    "你在河床下发现了某种微微发光的东西，它深深藏在岩石之间。"

translate schinese_rewrite mossy_freshwater_loop_b4f1ef41:

    # "You use the trowel you brought with you, and dig through the smooth sand and mud underwater."
    "你用随身带来的泥铲，在水下挖开光滑的沙土和泥。"

translate schinese_rewrite mossy_freshwater_loop_06a740d9:

    # "Soon, the hole becomes deep enough that you notice a branch glowing blue."
    "很快，坑洞深到足以让你发现一根泛着蓝光的树枝。"

translate schinese_rewrite mossy_freshwater_loop_9e9f2c2c:

    # "With a little push, you pull out the branch, and feel a powerful aura coursing through your body..."
    "你稍微用力，把树枝拔了出来，一股强大的气息在你体内涌动……"

translate schinese_rewrite mossy_freshwater_loop_bc4d7076:

    # "It must be a trinket."
    "这一定是件小饰品。"

translate schinese_rewrite mossy_freshwater_loop_f0df0c49:

    # "You carefully put it in your bag. And step away from the water."
    "你小心翼翼地把它放进背包，然后离开水边。"

translate schinese_rewrite mossy_freshwater_loop_7a4dea47_1:

    # "You try to dig through the mud with your bare hand... but to no avail, it seems to not work."
    "你试着徒手挖开泥土……但毫无作用，看来这样行不通。"

translate schinese_rewrite mossy_freshwater_loop_0ba9ac66_1:

    # "You decide to move on, maybe you need something small that can dig..."
    "你决定继续前进，也许你需要某种小巧的挖掘工具……"

translate schinese_rewrite mossy_freshwater_loop_296a0bf4:

    # "After walking along the river for a while, you decide to climb upstream and explore the forest above."
    "沿着河边走了一会儿后，你决定向上游攀登，探索上方的森林。"

translate schinese_rewrite mossy_freshwater_loop_f41a40bc:

    # "As soon as you peek up, you see a giant red flag in front of you, it was an old abandoned settlement that seemed to be build by the goats."
    "你刚一探头，就看见前方一面巨大的红旗。那是一处古老的废弃聚落，似乎是山羊们建造的。"

translate schinese_rewrite mossy_freshwater_loop_97331535:

    # "You take out your map and mark the location, this place must be the woodland outpost."
    "你拿出地图标记地点，这里肯定就是林地前哨站。"

translate schinese_rewrite mossy_freshwater_loop_dd81e7d4:

    # "After walking along the river for a while, you take a rest on the slippery rock..."
    "沿着河边走了一会儿后，你在一块湿滑的岩石上休息……"

translate schinese_rewrite mossy_freshwater_loop_adcef476:

    # "Ouch!"
    "哎哟！"

translate schinese_rewrite mossy_freshwater_loop_4c85091a:

    # "There's something under your butt, but luckily it's just a small note..."
    "你的屁股底下硌着什么东西，不过幸好，那只是一张小纸条……"

translate schinese_rewrite mossy_freshwater_loop_c9ab56ee:

    # "{i}HOW TO MAKE SOFT FABRIC...{/i}"
    "{i}如何制作柔软布料……{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite mossy_freshwater_loop_0fd98fba:

    # "It's a recipe for soft fabric, you put it aside, maybe it'll be useful when you go back to Rahim's workshop."
    "这是一份制作柔软布料的配方，你把它收了起来，也许回到雷希姆的工坊时能派上用场。"

translate schinese_rewrite mossy_freshwater_loop_f3fcd3e8:

    # "After walking along the river for a while, you decide to travel upstream."
    "沿着河边走了一会儿后，你决定前往上游。"

translate schinese_rewrite mossy_freshwater_loop_14bb8b3d:

    # "You follow the river bank and walk opposite to where the water goes, you ascend and climb until you see a huge waterfall."
    "你沿着河岸逆流而上，不断攀登，直到看见一座巨大的瀑布。"

translate schinese_rewrite mossy_freshwater_loop_52d25bed:

    # "It seems you've arrived to the Sundersilk Cascades, you talk out your map and mark the location."
    "看来你已经抵达剪绸瀑布。你拿出地图，标记了这里的位置。"

translate schinese_rewrite mossy_freshwater_loop_e91ba75d_1:

    # "You search around the area for a while, but there seem to be nothing worth noting nearby."
    "你在附近搜寻了一阵，但周围似乎没有什么值得留意的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite woodland_outpost_loop_b9952a9e:

    # "While you are exploring the outpost, a shade of a giant brown creature lunges itself towards your side. You instantly get pushed on the ground."
    "当你探索哨站时，一个巨大的棕色身影朝你扑来。你立刻被扑倒在地。"

translate schinese_rewrite woodland_outpost_loop_e4ba1378:

    # "You can feel the brown figure's armor clashing against your body, you struggle for a while before getting off the creature."
    "你能感觉到棕色身影的铠甲撞击着你的身体。你挣扎了好一会儿，才从这个生物身下脱身。"

translate schinese_rewrite woodland_outpost_loop_716e94fa:

    # "When you try to stand up and get a clear vision of the figure, you found out that he is a buggbear, he is holding his mace, growling angrily towards you."
    "你试着站起来看清那个身影，这才发现那是一头熊地精。它手里握着狼牙棒，正朝你愤怒地咆哮。"

translate schinese_rewrite woodland_outpost_loop_e91ba75d:

    # "You search around the area for a while, but there seem to be nothing worth noting nearby."
    "你在附近搜寻了一阵，但周围似乎没有什么值得留意的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite woodland_outpost_loop_e91ba75d_1:

    # "You search around the area for a while, but there seem to be nothing worth noting nearby."
    "你在附近搜寻了一阵，但周围似乎没有什么值得留意的东西。"

